Action: run_sql({'query': "SELECT e.name, r.rating, r.text\nFROM review r\nJOIN establishments e ON r.gmap_id = e.gmap_id\nWHERE e.name IN ('Rancherito''s Mexican Food', 'Mestizo Coffee House', 'El Cabrito', 'Chubby''s Mexican Restaurant', 'Panaderia Flores Rose Park', 'Santo Taco', 'El Jaripeo Taco Truck (Rose Park)', 'Nico''s Restaurant', 'Don Daniel''s Mexican Grill & Cantina', 'That Sandwich Shop')\n  AND (\n    LOWER(r.text) LIKE '%breakfast%'\n    OR LOWER(r.text) LIKE '%burrito%'\n    OR LOWER(r.text) LIKE '%egg%'\n    OR LOWER(r.text) LIKE '%chorizo%'\n    OR LOWER(r.text) LIKE '%machaca%'\n    OR LOWER(r.text) LIKE '%savory%'\n    OR LOWER(r.text) LIKE '%tamale%'\n    OR LOWER(r.text) LIKE '%torta%'\n  )\nORDER BY e.name, r.rating DESC\nLIMIT 50;"})

Observation: {"row_count": 50, "truncated": false, "rows": [{"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "By far the best Mexican in the area. I'm not sure what the green sauce was that they put on their tamales but my mouth is still watering just thinking about it. Although the neighborhood has a reputation for being a little sketch, this establishment feels safe, is clean and had a fun vibe. Great children's menu as well."}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Always delicious Chili Verde Burrito Special! Homemade tortillas- it hit the spot!  Old neighborhood favorite! Awesome service...we'll be back soon! \ud83d\ude00"}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Chubby's is one of my local favorites. If I'm in the area and feel like Mexican this is one of my 2 go tos.\nThe chips and salsa is average but everything else that I've tried is great. All of their meats are full of flavor and very tender. Today I went with a smothered shreded beef burrito. It was exellent."}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Love the smother burrito rice and beans....really good place to eat"}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Massive Burritos, great service, friendly employees, great food."}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Ordered the smothered burritos with the shredded beef and the wife had the chimichanga and it was one of the best Mexican restaurants i've been to in years and it was very clean and the waitress was very nice we will definitely be going back there soon"}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Delicious authentic Mexican food on piping hot plates served in a charming space with great decor. I had the Small Combination substituted the cheese enchilada for a shredded beef one and smothered the burrito. The red and green sauces are delicious with just the right amount of heat/spice. If you get this and want your taco crispy, ask for the taco on the side for my shell had become saturated with the delicious sauce and fell apart."}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Great prices. Definitely a local dig. Enjoyed the rice and bean burrito, they have those thick fluffy tortillas. Complimentary chips and salsa, not too spicy."}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Best smothered pork Chile Verde burrito."}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Best food ever, breakfast, lunch or dinner. Never a disappointment!"}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Delicious Food! Love the Breakfast Plate with Papas & Chile Verde or Colorado :)"}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Thanks Lisa! Breakfast was yummy! Great time and great food!"}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Smothered chicken burrito is yummy. Great service too!"}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Good chips and salsa and their shredded beef burritos are awesome!   I also like their Texas Enchiladas."}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "We went here to try a new place and loved the food. Ordered a tamale and a chimichanga and they were both amazing! My one year old couldn't get enough of the tamale so it wasn't too spicy. Definitely will return for more."}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "best chilli verde in town\nsmother a burrito with cheese\nyou will never frown"}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Delicious Food! Love the Breakfast Plate with Papas & Chile Verde or Colorado :)"}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Excellent authentic Mexican food. A once a week visit for co workers and I. The chubbychanga platter and smothered burrito are my usual go to. Free chips and salsa as well! Great service and good price."}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "I think this is one of the best kept secrets of the Rose Park / Fairpark area.  They have great Mexican food and great prices.  I\u2019ve enjoyed everything that I\u2019ve ordered from here.  They have a great chili verde and my wife loves the nachos.  The tamales are good too.  I think they could do a little better with the salsa that they bring as an appetizer but it wouldn\u2019t stop me from going there.  If you\u2019re feeling adventurous, wash your meal down with a 1/2 Diet Coke and 1/2 Red Cream Soda mixture."}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "I had the smothered burrito with shredded beef and my husband had the chicken enchiladas. Both of us were highly satisfied and will be making this one of our go-to Mexican restaurants."}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "(Translated by Google) Give bomb smothered burritos and beans and rice. I like very much\n\n(Original)\nDa bomb smothered burritos and frijoles y arroz . me gusta mucho"}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "The food is delicious, fast, and freshly made, not greasy, cheap and microwaved like a lot of other places. I liked LA puente and LA frontera before but this places smothered burritos put em both to shame. The prices are fair,  its got a bit of a tight fit and its busy at certain times, but the atmosphere there is very humble and has an at-home type of feel to it, definitely recommend it!"}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Biggest and best burrito i have ever had!!!"}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Get the #5 combo...best tamale in your life.  Good service."}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Love the order of 3 smothered burritos"}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Family friendly and delicious food! My breakfast burritos \ud83c\udf2f\nTheir the bomb \ud83d\ude0b"}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Found this place by accident and I'm really glad I did. Ordered a Carne asada burrito and there was not one drop of Grease in it or on the plate when i was done. Was so good. I will be back many many times."}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Very tasty Burritos and tacos are served in hygienic conditions"}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Amazing service best smothered burrito on this side of town highly recommended!!!"}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 4.0, "text": "Its decent Mexican food. I always get the smothered burrito combo. I ended up buying 2 fried ice creams and those were pretty good."}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 4.0, "text": "Good variety of Mexican food.  Love the green chile burritos and reasonably priced meals"}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 4.0, "text": "Good variety of Mexican food.  Love the green chile burritos and reasonably priced meals"}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 4.0, "text": "First time there had a smothered burrito with cheese and onions with beans. Food and service was great. Will definitely come back \ud83d\udc4d\ud83d\udc4d"}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 4.0, "text": "Best place with chili verde love the three smothered burritos large combination my favorites"}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 3.0, "text": "My family has been eating at Chubby's since 1989,.  I almost always get the Tamale Special smothered with rice an beans and am rarely disappointed.  It is a friendly place when we walk in we first look around to see who we know there.  The Chile Relleno is hit or miss, sometimes super greasy and other times super delicious.  The salsa has changed over the years to where it tastes like straight red chilis with tomato sauce.  The chile verde enchilada is also good.  My husband always gets the two enchiladas rice and bean, ground beef and my son always gets cheese enchiladas.  Sister in law always gets the chimichanga.  Prices are reasonable and the staff is friendly.  We love it there."}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 3.0, "text": "Quality Mexican food. Great smothered burritos. The orders me and my brothers recwiver had hard rice that wasn't flavorful. The burrito wasn't as good as usual. Salsa was spicy but really watery. Chips were very hard and stale."}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 3.0, "text": "Not as good as La Frontera and I paid almost the same price as La Frontera. Some of the meat was burned. Found a piece of fat in my burrito. I wouldn't recommend Cubby's. Only the Coke and cheese enchilada was good."}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 3.0, "text": "Quality Mexican food. Great smothered burritos. The orders me and my brothers recwiver had hard rice that wasn't flavorful. The burrito wasn't as good as usual. Salsa was spicy but really watery. Chips were very hard and stale."}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 2.0, "text": "(Translated by Google) I arrive 20 minutes to close and they did not let me pass ,,, what a shame. ..\ud83d\udc4e\ud83d\udc4e\ud83d\udc4e\ud83d\udc4e\ud83d\udc4e\ud83d\udc4e\ud83d\udc4e I just wanted a burrito\n\n(Original)\nLlego 20 minutos para cerrar  y no me dejaron pasar ,,, que lastima. ..\ud83d\udc4e\ud83d\udc4e\ud83d\udc4e\ud83d\udc4e\ud83d\udc4e\ud83d\udc4e\ud83d\udc4eyo solo quer\u00eda un burrito"}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 2.0, "text": "Standard Utah smothered burrito BS with Salsa out of a plastic bottle, and stale chips off of a Sysco truck. Is this really what people think Mexican Cuisine is?? I'm reading the other reviews of this place and I'm wondering if these other people are eating at the same place I am. I guess if you melt some yellow cheese over some tomato sauce and wrap it in a tortilla that serves as Mexican food in Salt Lake. I don't know what this is, but I've been to Mexico enough to know that this is anything but authentic."}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 1.0, "text": "Chubby's has been a life time favorite of mine and my family. So why the one star? Well, in the past year they've messed up more of my orders than I've bothered to count. No, I actually mean that. It's probably 7-10 times, is my guess.\n\nWas I ordering some absurdly complicated order? No, I order the same thing literally every time. Two smothered burritos, no cheese. Guess what it has almost every time? Cheese. It's not hard, but it's a simple mistake so I just forgave it over and over.\n\nTonight, I made my same order again. And guess, what? It was wrong, again. I don't even know why I've bothered for so long. Maybe I'm a dramatic twerp, you think. However, I can't eat cheese, so it does spoil the meal.\n\nThe reviews for Chubby's are great, as you can see. But I cannot rightfully recommend it when I've been scorned so many times in a year. Unfortunately, and quite sadly, I'm probably never going back to Chubby's again."}, {"name": "Chubby's Mexican Restaurant", "rating": 1.0, "text": "Ketchup is not salsa. If it wasn't ketchup it was tomato sauce. Smothered burritos made me puke about 1 hour later. Even my 83 year old mom was disappointed as it was her choice to go there. I was sad as this place is sapose to be good as per most reviews. I grew up I the neighborhood and will make sure to tell everyone to go back to la frontera much better in my opinion."}, {"name": "Don Daniel's Mexican Grill & Cantina", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Great food, I am from Las Vegas Nev and came to visit a friend from Centerville and she brought me to this place and the food was delicious.  Had breakfast and dinner here. Yes visit here great food."}, {"name": "Don Daniel's Mexican Grill & Cantina", "rating": 5.0, "text": "The smothered burrito tasted to much like an enchilada but its aight"}, {"name": "Don Daniel's Mexican Grill & Cantina", "rating": 5.0, "text": "I\u2019ve been here twice. Had the burrito a la Diabla both times and I really like it. I like the feel of the place and the people are nice."}, {"name": "Don Daniel's Mexican Grill & Cantina", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Friendly staff, good food. Smothered burrito could feed two."}, {"name": "Don Daniel's Mexican Grill & Cantina", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Best TACOS DE ASADA ever!! No one else can compare to this savory flavor. The seafood options are all very fresh and the fact that the owner is the \"main chef\" because he's so passionate about the food is exactly why it's so delicious! The staff is always friendly too!  I come here about once a week, guess I can't get enough!!"}, {"name": "Don Daniel's Mexican Grill & Cantina", "rating": 5.0, "text": "Great authentic Mexican food with a variety of options.  They have mariscos, tacos of asada, pollo, cabeza, lengua, tripa, burritos, menudo, pezole, and several other dishes.  If you're looking for Mexican food, that really is Mexican, this is your restaurant!"}, {"name": "Don Daniel's Mexican Grill & Cantina", "rating": 5.0, "text": "The burrito is delicious...."}, {"name": "Don Daniel's Mexican Grill & Cantina", "rating": 5.0, "text": "It is a wonderful place. Even it's location has an end of the world feeling. I got horchata which maybe next in town after maybe one of rancho market. It is a very colorful place. There are pictures on all chairs. Simple pictures but together the feeling it create is amazing. Try burrito al diablo. A very good choice."}]}

